{"product_id":"buture-pro-bp10-vacuum-floor-brush","title":"Buture Floor Brush for BP10 Vacuum","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoller brush is not included. Suitable for BP10 and VC70 Model Vacuum.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch5\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTips:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/h5\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eThe BP10 Vacuum Cleaner has been upgraded since 2024. We recommend buying a set of floor brushes and roller brushes to avoid incompatibility issues.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTwo Types of BP10 Roller Brushes: Hard Brush is more suitable for carpets clean. Soft Brush is more suitable for floors clean.\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ol\u003e","brand":"Buture Official","offers":[{"title":"1 piece","offer_id":46235727528191,"sku":"BP10DS1","price":36.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"2 pieces","offer_id":46235727560959,"sku":"BP10DS2","price":59.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"1 Floor Brush + 1 Roller Soft Brush","offer_id":46360894406911,"sku":"BP10DS1GS1R","price":55.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true},{"title":"1 Floor Brush + 1 Roller Hard Brush","offer_id":46295471554815,"sku":"BP10DS1GS1Y","price":55.99,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0621\/7462\/6047\/files\/11_8cdaa85a-113d-43cb-941a-27b9f53d3bbb.jpg?v=1774000176","url":"https:\/\/ibuture.com\/products\/buture-pro-bp10-vacuum-floor-brush","provider":"Buture Official","version":"1.0","type":"link"}